{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7aebb725-044b-8a29-a47c-70d6acf0851b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:16:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bruce Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Denise. My name is Bruce Brownell. I am calling about snow plowing on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Brownell. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring Street. Number 387 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. Three eight seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 387 Spring. What's going on, hasn't it been plowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not yet. Snow still on the road. My street is dead end, so I think plow come last. Always last, every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right about that, dead ends do tend to get done last. The crews do the main roads first, then the side streets, and the dead ends come at the end of the run."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand this. So I want to ask, when it will be cleared? Today, or tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, sometime this afternoon is my best guess. If they get held up, it could slide into the evening. I'd say plan on later today rather than this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Later today. Okay. This afternoon, maybe evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am waiting for a friend, he is coming to my house. He always late, every time, so maybe is okay. Maybe plow come before he come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, sometimes that works out in your favor. If he gets there first and it's slippery, tell him to take it slow on the hill coming down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I will tell him. Slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to put a note in that you called? I can pass it along so the crew knows the street hasn't been touched yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That is good. Do you need my phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead, in case dispatch wants to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Zero one six two. Zero one six two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0162. And the address again is 387 Spring Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Three eight seven Spring Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set, I've got it noted. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Brownell. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
